E_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4197608738,"text":"どうしたの？","nextNodeIds":[722830103]},{"nodeId":722830103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":1363787338,"text":"射撃訓練の記録が日に日に悪くなってきてるんだ。このままでは、いつか矢を膝に刺してしまうかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[722830104]},{"nodeId":722830104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1360312562,"text":"どうしてこんなところで弓の練習を？","nextNodeIds":[722830105]},{"nodeId":722830105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":2647901114,"text":"それは…！地走官に言われたからだ。彼らはきっと、人が苦しむのを見るのが好きなんだ…","nextNodeIds":[722830106]},{"nodeId":722830106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":2400604546,"text":"ところでお前、陸ウナギの養殖の心得はあるか？このまま弓の練習をしても将来が見えないから、俺は何か別のことをやろうと思ってるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[722830107]},{"nodeId":722830107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":628117850,"text":"陸ウナギの養殖と弓の練習って関係あるの？","nextNodeIds":[722830108]},{"nodeId":722830108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":3422309466,"text":"なるほど、お前は陸ウナギの養殖について何も知らないみたいだな。","nextNodeIds":[722830109]},{"nodeId":722830109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":3987688698,"text":"陸ウナギを養殖するには、まず稚魚を集めないといけない。しかし、陸ウナギの稚魚は非常に小さくてな。肉眼ではなかなか見つけられないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[722830110]},{"nodeId":722830110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":2012001018,"text":"射手は、遠くの的を射られるだろう。だから、視力が優れているんじゃないかと思った。そこで知り合いの地走官に、どうやって視力を鍛えるのか聞いてみたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[722830111]},{"nodeId":722830111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":1212905170,"text":"「明石よ、鍛練は少しずつ積み重ねねばならない。基礎がしっかりしているからこそ、次の段階でうまくいくのだ。」","nextNodeIds":[722830112]},{"nodeId":722830112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":3596635154,"text":"「稚魚は小さくよく動き回るが、当然、静止した的から始めよ。近すぎると意味がないから、遠い的から練習することだ。」","nextNodeIds":[722830113]},{"nodeId":722830113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":230083466,"text":"そう言われたから、ここで弓の練習をしてみてるんだ。だが、今のところ、一度も成功していない。あんなに遠くの的に当てられる人なんているのかよ…","nextNodeIds":[722830114]},{"nodeId":722830114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":3738941922,"text":"そうだ、お前もやってみるか？そこの石板に立てば、的が見える。全て命中すれば成功だ。","nextNodeIds":[722830115]},{"nodeId":722830115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3262345946,"text":"やってみる。","nextNodeIds":[722830116]},{"nodeId":722830116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":1179528018,"text":"お手並み拝見だ！成功したら教えてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7228301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7228302,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":0,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"72283_Success"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_