Id":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":1870939882,"text":"お前は陸ウナギが好きか？","nextNodeIds":[722830305,722830306]},{"nodeId":722830305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1315918538,"text":"好き。","nextNodeIds":[722830307]},{"nodeId":722830307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":3281053330,"text":"そうか。俺は陸ウナギが大好きでな。好きすぎるから、自分で養殖しようと思ったんだ。あいつら、すごく可愛いと思わないか？","nextNodeIds":[722830308]},{"nodeId":722830308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":3637281610,"text":"料理になった陸ウナギも勿論、さらに美しい。見た目もいいし、何より美味いんだ。","nextNodeIds":[722830309]},{"nodeId":722830309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":3380708434,"text":"陸ウナギが好きだから養殖をしたいのに、その陸ウナギを飼育するために弓の練習ばかりしている。これって本末転倒じゃないか？","nextNodeIds":[722830310]},{"nodeId":722830310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":161237074,"text":"結局、俺はやっぱり自由な陸ウナギが好きなんだ。養殖のことはもう忘れよう。","nextNodeIds":[722830311]},{"nodeId":722830311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20345,"speakerName":"明石","textMapHash":2790099322,"text":"そうだ、手本を見せてくれてありがとうな。これはお前にやるよ、これからも頑張れよ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722830306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":150982570,"text":"いや、ちょっと苦手。","nextNodeIds":[722830307]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7228303,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["5","155006018"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL"